  "description": ".NET client SDK for the ECM (AppGateway) HTTP APIs: documents, files, tags, workspaces, outbox and on-behalf authentication. The shared API contracts (FoxTS.Ecm.Sdk.Contracts) are bundled inside this package — no separate package reference is required.",
